{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2019-12", "window": 1, "start_date": 1575158400, "end_date": 1575763199, "month_true_total": 148, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 17:57:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "59439851", "author": {"steamid": "76561198257553388", "personaname": "Crippled Chronos Addict", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Fooseetoob/", "num_games_owned": 399, "num_reviews": 77, "playtime_forever": 1059, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 205, "last_played": 1690841070, "avatar": "de7b60a2cc25d3145a98bfae53b9899fb0304344"}, "language": "english", "review": "Papa smurf would be proud", "timestamp_created": 1575743802, "timestamp_updated": 1575743802, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "59436838", "author": {"steamid": "76561198094615384", "personaname": "Happy-Birb", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198094615384/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 5, "playtime_forever": 576, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 442, "last_played": 1575943699, "avatar": "922d937313cd3dd356510daf0090f4b26fff0c82"}, "language": "english", "review": "Simple game with lots of explosions and ork noises. 10/10, for the Emperor!\n", "timestamp_created": 1575740926, "timestamp_updated": 1575740926, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "59428051", "author": {"steamid": "76561198061914709", "personaname": "Monollock", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198061914709/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 121, "playtime_forever": 414, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 414, "last_played": 1575729640, "avatar": "31c5a03f314234c1797aa46c74539ce8b12a8334"}, "language": "english", "review": "Got it 50% off\n6 hours, Gameplay gets old quickly and there's an almost critical gameplay flaw where you're locked into long execution animations while still vunerable meaning you can die in the middle of the animation or lose most of your health the moment you've finished recovering health. this swouldn't be too big of a problem if it wasn't for the fact it's one of two methods of recovering health. Meaning most of the time you have to wait until there's only one enemy on their own to recover health. The gunplay is just kinda boring, you're plinking away at enemies for a while since alot of the time melee just isn't worth it.\n\nI don't regret getting the game, the voice logs were interesting and funny in some parts, lore knowledge is required to enjoy this game I'd say, without it, it's just cardboard characters and boring action. The multiplayer is supposedly some of the best warhammer you'll get but until I try it. This game is a mostly no from me.", "timestamp_created": 1575733055, "timestamp_updated": 1575733055, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "59390748", "author": {"steamid": "76561198072745223", "personaname": "jfchalmers", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198072745223/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playti